        "review_body": "I like my stuff, but I always wear an XL & luckily I know how to sew. The tops were so big on me I had to take them in 2” on each side. Now they fit good & I’m loving them. The other reason for only 4 stars was due to how long it took to get my order, but on that note I will definitely order again I absolutely love my leggings & short/skirt peace. I shared the website with a friend because they loved what I wore & since then I complimented a stranger on their one piece, romper set and found out that it came from Halara so I hope to find that and purchase my own :). ",
